    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 Bedroom Apartment\r\n\r\nThe two-bedroom apartments at Lightburne have been thoughtfully designed to provide spacious, contemporary accommodation that perfectly balances style, comfort and practicality. Generous open-plan living, dining and kitchen areas create a bright and welcoming environment, ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. Large windows maximise natural light throughout, while private balconies or terraces offer valuable outdoor space to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nThe apartments feature two well-proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom with excellent storage, complemented by a beautifully finished bathroom and high-quality fittings throughout. Clever layouts ensure every square metre is utilised efficiently, creating homes that are both functional and comfortable.\r\n\r\nBuilt to the highest modern standards, these A-rated homes deliver exceptional energy efficiency, helping to reduce running costs while providing year-round comfort. Located beside the Glencairn Luas Stop, residents benefit from superb connectivity to Sandyford, Dundrum and Dublin City Centre, along with a wealth of nearby amenities, shopping, dining and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nCombining contemporary design, sustainable living and an outstanding Dublin 18 location, the two-bedroom apartments at Lightburne offer an exceptional opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike."
      },
